  "content": "[Intro]\n[C#5]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C#sus4]High in the halls of the\nkings who are [C#sus2]gone\nJenny would dance with her\n[C#5]ghosts The\nones she had lost and the ones\nshe had [C#sus4]found And the ones\nwho had loved her the\n[C#5]most\nThe\n\n[Verse 2]\n[C#5]ones who'd been gone for so\n[E]very long [B]She\ncouldn't remember their\n[C#5]names They\nspun her around on the damp\n[E]old [B]stones Spun a-\nway all her sorrow and\n[A]pain And she\n\n[Chorus]\n[F#m]never wanted to\n[E]leave,\n[F#m]never wanted to\n[Amaj7]leave Ne-\n[F#m]ver wanted to\n[E]leave,\n[G#m7]never wanted to\n[C#m]leave\n[C#m/B]They\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Amaj7]danced through the day\nAnd into the [B/A]night through the\nsnow that swept through the\n[Amaj7]hall From\nwinter to summer and win-\nter [B/A]again Til the\nwalls did crumble and\n[Amaj7]fall\n[C#m/G#]And she\n\n[Chorus]\n[F#m]never wanted to\n[E]leave,\n[F#m]never wanted to\n[Amaj7]leave\n[F#m]Never wanted to\n[E]leave,\n[G#sus4]never wanted to\n[Amaj7]leave And she\n[B]never wanted to\n[E]leave,\n[Amaj7]never wanted [B]to\n[C#m]leave\n[B]Never wanted to\n[E]leave,\n[G#sus4]never wanted to\n\n[Break]\n[Amaj9]leave\n\n[Outro]\n[C#sus4]High in the halls of the\nkings who are [C#sus2]gone\nJenny would dance with her\n[C#5]ghosts The\nones she had lost and the ones\nshe had [C#sus4]found And the ones\nwho had loved her the\n[C#5]most",
